ce with one candidate, we just take a note of it in our applicant tracking system, but then we just forget about you, move on to the rest of our job and nobody's any the wiser. But, the real version i", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=4OmEbeR3BtI\u0026t=765s", "end": 839.71, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "5efbf435ed298e48f009033f6c7fe783feb1a16bfb2ba0b9817cd57607d81b88", "start": 765.12, "text": "record. But, what I would recommend that you do going forward with other employers is stop mass applying. Mass applying is one of the fastest ways for you to get onto the do not call list. Reason being is is that I spoke about this earlier ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=4OmEbeR3BtI\u0026t=839s", "end": 1004.48, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "a3633d10a669ecaae451ae5b0a42f1db274f3d4b13734266fc9b92150cad11ca", "start": 839.72, "text": "work with. Instead of applying, before you submit your application, try to get it as an employee referral. There is a slim possibility that you can get past a do not hire list if you come with an endorsement first. But, that's probably the ", "timing": "coarse", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Job Hunt and Career", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=4OmEbeR3BtI\u0026t=1s", "end": 92.95, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "b819c5c137d141bd7b9a492bb91b4d967e30e3c95f7e231e2ecb2c09cbadf187", "start": 1.55, "text": "A little while ago, I made a video on how a meta leak surfaced that there are do not call lists that people are shadow banned from ever getting hired at the company no matter what they do. And the video itself did pretty well. People were r", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=4OmEbeR3BtI\u0026t=149s", "end": 316.35, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "c5a88e4e72dcf62792