 make. So I have a few apps that are already running. Among them there are features like important features I have to ship. Initially I didn't have many problems but as you start to make stuff you wil", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=D4fkiQfzw_I\u0026t=367s", "end": 415.43, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "3251a9316e0adafaa70cd30cfa685d5df97d113a1b5f61d09156759a220991d3", "start": 367.909, "text": "We're always afraid to show our new creation and uh your ideals to the world in the first time. Just keep in mind that that that's the biggest barrier to your success ever. There's this little voice inside of your head telling you that it's", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=D4fkiQfzw_I\u0026t=418s", "end": 514.469, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "cbfa354f3610ce67f8ff82baf6627edc56643b8cf2957afb898b6d0cbfe9cd40", "start": 418.55, "text": "\u003e\u003e The only way to validate an idea is to ship it with a buy button. Now with AI that it's even easier to ship stuff. This even more true. I have a slightly controversial take on AI is that there's a bunch of people who are obsessed with pr", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Playlist", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=D4fkiQfzw_I\u0026t=3s", "end": 56.389, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "a92c1e7c256d92f268af8d6c8c5298856922d787834e9f9c91d376657a299b5e", "start": 3.83, "text": "So basically I work all days all year long. I love my day so much that I want to repeat it every single day. I don't like Sundays cuz my my fun is actually making stuff. So I don't see why I would take a day off and when I go on holiday usu", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=D4fkiQfzw_I\u0026t=58s", "end": 163.509, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "c387219